Source: chimeradb
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ChimeraDB contributors <support@mieweb.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/mieweb/chimeraDB

Package: chimeradb-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash, mariadb-client
Description: Mongo-compatible access to MariaDB - administration and SQL assets
 ChimeraDB adds a Mongo wire listener and bidirectional document/SQL access to
 MariaDB. This package provides chimeradb setup, status and start, plus the
 catalog SQL and manual. The Mongo listener has no authentication; packaged
 installations bind it to 127.0.0.1 only.
 .
 MongoDB is a trademark of MongoDB, Inc. MariaDB is a trademark of MariaDB plc.
 ChimeraDB is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
 sponsored by MongoDB, Inc. or MariaDB plc. "MongoDB compatibility" describes
 wire-protocol interoperability, not provenance.

Package: chimeradb-plugin-@SERIES@
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, chimeradb-common (= ${binary:Version}), mariadb-server (= ${server:Version})
Provides: chimeradb-plugin (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: chimeradb-plugin
Replaces: chimeradb-plugin
Description: Mongo-compatible access to MariaDB @SERIES@ - server plugin
 The chimera_mongo plugin is built against exactly the MariaDB package named
 in Depends. Rebuild this plugin when upgrading that server package: its SQL
 gateway accesses server internals. The Mongo listener has no authentication
 and binds to 127.0.0.1:27017 by default. Run chimeradb setup after restarting
 MariaDB; installing this package never connects to or modifies a database.
 .
 MongoDB is a trademark of MongoDB, Inc. MariaDB is a trademark of MariaDB plc.
 ChimeraDB is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
 sponsored by MongoDB, Inc. or MariaDB plc. "MongoDB compatibility" describes
 wire-protocol interoperability, not provenance.

Package: chimeradb
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, chimeradb-common (= ${binary:Version}), chimeradb-plugin (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Mongo-compatible access to MariaDB - metapackage
 Installs ChimeraDB administration commands and a matching server plugin.
 Select the plugin package for your MariaDB series. The Mongo listener has
 no authentication and is restricted to 127.0.0.1 by default.
 .
 MongoDB is a trademark of MongoDB, Inc. MariaDB is a trademark of MariaDB plc.
 ChimeraDB is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
 sponsored by MongoDB, Inc. or MariaDB plc. "MongoDB compatibility" describes
 wire-protocol interoperability, not provenance.
